  "policy": {
    "privacy": "# Privacy\n\nVibe Coding is maintained by Arty S. / ARTSIOM SATSUK ([arty-kk](https://github.com/arty-kk)).\n\nThe distributed plugin contains text instructions, a local catalog and local Python utilities. It has no publisher-operated backend, analytics, tracking pixels, cookies, account system or telemetry. Its catalog and packaging utilities do not send project contents to the publisher.\n\nWhen the plugin is used in Codex, ChatGPT or Claude, the host processes prompts, files and tool results under the host's settings and policies. Workflows may use tools and services that the user has enabled; those services apply their own data policies. The plugin does not grant itself additional permissions.\n\nThe public website is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may process ordinary request information under its privacy policy. Information voluntarily posted in repository issues or pull requests is public and handled by GitHub. Do not post credentials, private source code or personal data.\n\nThe website and offline catalog store only your selected language and assistant in your browser's local storage. These preferences are not sent to the publisher.\n\nThe plugin does not collect or retain prompts or project files on a publisher server. Browser preferences remain until you change them or clear the corresponding browser storage. The maintainer uses information you voluntarily post in support threads to answer your request and investigate reported issues. Those posts remain on GitHub and can be edited or deleted using GitHub controls, subject to GitHub's retention policy. Hosting logs, support content and data-rights requests handled by GitHub are governed by the [GitHub Privacy Statement](https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement). Use your assistant's settings and support channels for access, retention or deletion of data processed by that assistant.\n\nPrivacy questions can be raised at [https://github.com/arty-kk/vibe-coding/issues](https://github.com/arty-kk/vibe-coding/issues) without including sensitive details.\n",
    "terms": "# Terms\n\nVibe Coding is distributed by Arty S. / ARTSIOM SATSUK ([arty-kk](https://github.com/arty-kk)) under the [MIT License](LICENSE). Use, modification and redistribution of the software are governed by that license.\n\nThe plugin has no subscription or paid publisher service. The host application and any external services you choose to use remain subject to their own terms and charges.\n\nReview generated changes and validation results before using them in a live environment. The software is provided as is, with the warranty disclaimer and limitation of liability stated in the MIT License.\n\nSupport is available through [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/arty-kk/vibe-coding/issues) on a best-effort basis.\n"
  }
